BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Stanford BeWell / Stanford Healthy Living] Preserving the Fall Ap
 ple Harvest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T190000
DTSTAMP:20261006T184750Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-53741880094507-53741880095534@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Apples are one of the quintessential flavors of fall. Join us 
 for this hands-on workshop at the O'Donohue Family Stanford Educational Fa
 rm\, where you will explore ways to capture\, enhance\, and preserve the s
 eason's harvest.\n\nWe will start with a tasting of several apple varietie
