 and Munger Rotunda of the Cecil H. Green Library from September 22\, 2026 
 to January 24\, 2027. \n\nRoxane Debuisson (1927–2018) dedicated sixty y
 ears to documenting the transformation of the city of Paris during the nin
 eteenth century.  If Roxane Debuisson could not stop the changes she saw u
 nderway in the late 20th century\, she could at least preserve the city’
 s ea\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-10-06 11:47 PDT
LOCATION:Green Library\, Bing Wing
END:VEVENT
